<title>USA: Envirodyne Industries Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Envirodyne Industries Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.02     loss	$ 0.42</p>
<p> Net profit		   300     loss	 5,600</p>
<p> Revs		     162,000		  162,500</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 earnings before depreciation, interest, amortization and taxes were $26.1 million vs $25.3 million.</p>
<p>Full name is Envirodyne Industries Inc.  </p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.96     loss	 $1.59</p>
<p> Net loss		  13,700     loss	21,500</p>
<p> Revs		     651,400		  650,200</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year earnings before depreciation, interest, amortization and taxes were $98.1 million vs $94.2 million.</p>
<p>1995 year results include loss of $4.2 million or $0.31/shr for early extinguishment of debt in connection with the company's June 1995 refinancing.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
